<div class="page-header"><h1>Become a Kitchen Cabinet Dealer in Idaho</h1><p>Pinnacle Sales is the manufacturer's representative for Shiloh, Eclipse, Aspect, Pronorm German Kitchens, and Vistora Closets across Idaho — recruiting and supporting kitchen & bath dealers from the fast-growing Treasure Valley to North Idaho's lakefront communities and the Sun Valley resort market, backed by 23+ years of in-market experience.</p></div>
<div class="content-narrow section">
<Breadcrumbs items={breadcrumbs} />

<h2 id="why-partner-with-pinnacle">Why Partner With Pinnacle Sales in Idaho</h2>
<p>If you run a kitchen & bath showroom or design studio in Idaho, Pinnacle Sales gives you a portfolio that spans every market tier — from semi-custom value built for the Treasure Valley's heavy new-construction volume to handleless German luxury for Coeur d'Alene lake homes and Ketchum resort builds. You get protected territory, in-person line training, design and quoting support, and showroom merchandising backed by 23+ years of dealer relationships.</p>

<h2 id="lines-you-can-carry">Premium Lines You Can Carry in Idaho</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry/">Shiloh Cabinetry</a></strong> — Custom paint and broad wood species; the versatile choice for Idaho's mix of transitional and mountain-modern kitchens, with strong dealer margins.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry/">Eclipse Cabinetry</a></strong> — Frameless, full-access construction for the clean contemporary builds rising across the region.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry/">Aspect Cabinetry</a></strong> — Value semi-custom built for the Treasure Valley's high new-construction volume in Boise, Meridian, and Eagle.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens/">Pronorm German Kitchens</a></strong> — Handleless, precision-engineered European fronts for high-end lake and resort homes, with protected dealer territory.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/vistora-closets/">Vistora Closets</a></strong> — Made-to-order closets and storage to grow whole-home revenue.</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="idaho-market-opportunity">The Idaho Market Opportunity</h2>
<p>Idaho is one of the country's fastest-growing kitchen markets, driven by new construction across Boise, Meridian, and Eagle alongside a high-end remodel market in Coeur d'Alene and Ketchum. Treasure Valley new construction favors painted perimeters with stained islands, shaker and modern-shaker doors, and durable, value-minded semi-custom — heavy demand for dealers carrying the right value line. In North Idaho's lakefront communities and the Sun Valley resort market, the look turns to mountain-modern luxury — knotty alder, rift oak, slatted wood, and increasingly clean <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry/">frameless</a> and handleless fronts — a high-margin opportunity for dealers carrying the German and full-access lines.</p>

<h2 id="dealer-support">Dealer Support That Drives Sales</h2>
<p>Pinnacle Sales backs Idaho dealers with hands-on sales training, 2020/Winner design and quoting support, showroom display programs, factory coordination, and ongoing business development. We work alongside your team to move projects from concept to order.</p>

